{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-la-mer-by-elie-saab","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"la-mer-arte-developments-al-marjan-island","about":"La Mer by ELIE SAAB is a landmark of refined elegance nestled on the pristine shores of Al Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Comprising three architecturally distinct towers, this branded residential development redefines coastal luxury with panoramic vistas of the Arabian Gulf, curated interiors by ELIE SAAB Maison, and timeless design sensibilities. Every element, from the exterior façade to the finest interior detail, reflects Elie Saab’s signature aesthetic—harmonizing modern opulence with serene waterfront living.Residents of La Mer will enjoy a collection of exquisitely designed 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as exclusive chalets, each crafted to evoke comfort, sophistication, and a bespoke lifestyle. With access to world-class amenities including sky pools, serenity parks, signature lounges, and wellness-focused facilities, La Mer offers more than a residence—it promises an immersive living experience where art, design, and tranquility converge on one of the UAE’s most coveted island destinations.","price":1830000,"title":"La Mer by ELIE SAAB","bitrix":{"id":1014,"pf_id":"are.2.14554","source":null,"project_id":"La Mer by Elie Saab","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"La Mer by ELIE SAAB","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"ARTE Developments","project_location":"Al Marjan Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/La_Mer_feature_d9b2d5ffc1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/La_Mer_feature_d9b2d5ffc1.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.687226811323985,"lng":55.73744758485388},"country":"ras-al-khaimah","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/la_mer_g_2_23d7043c0c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloud